**Fix summary:**
- Renamed `repoChanges` in `data()` to `localRepoChanges` — eliminates the duplicate definition conflict with the prop
- Updated all internal references from `this.repoChanges` → `this.localRepoChanges` in `refreshSummary()` and `buildFiles()`
- In `created()`, initialized `this.localRepoChanges = this.repoChanges || null` to sync the prop value on mount
- The `repoChanges` watcher now sets `this.localRepoChanges` instead of trying to reassign the prop

